==================================================
PUBLICATION
==================================================

Publishing must validate the course before publication.

At minimum verify:

- title exists
- required course metadata exists
- at least one chapter exists
- chapters contain valid lessons
- lessons have valid content/video references where required


Do not allow an obviously incomplete course to become Published.


==================================================
PROVIDER INTEGRATION
==================================================

Published courses must remain compatible with:

/providers/[slug]

The provider page will later aggregate:

- published profile
- published services
- published transport
- published products
- published courses


Do not implement the complete provider aggregation here.

Only ensure that published Academy data exposes a clean relationship
between course and provider.


